     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\">Hello all,</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\">I have been trying to simulate a longitudinal structure like below. </div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/attach/35d3c2773a48e/image.png?part=0.0.1&amp;view=1\" alt=\"image.png\" width=\"475\" height=\"542\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\">I have simulated input data for a factor mean vector and covariance matrix as below. </div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\">#simulated factor matrix<br>mu &lt;- c(0.00,0.50, 0.00,0.90)<br>cor &lt;- rockchalk::lazyCov(Rho=c(0.70,0.35,0.25,<br>                                  0.25,0.35,<br>                                  0.70),Sd=1)<br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\">My goal was to input the data in the model and recover the factor mean and cor parameters. Model implied factor mean and correlation matrix are close to the expected, but when I run lavPredict on the model and calculate the means, the results are off. See image below.</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\">SIM are the simulated factor parameters.</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\">EST are the results obtained with </div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\">lavInspect(sem_mod, what = &quot;est&quot;)$alpha<br>cov2cor(lavInspect(sem_mod, what = &quot;est&quot;)$psi )<br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\">STD are the results obtained with </div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\">lavInspect(sem_mod, what = &quot;std&quot;)$alpha<br>lavInspect(sem_mod, what = &quot;std&quot;)$psi<br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\">PREDICT were obtained like below.</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"># scores.ebm &lt;- lavaan::lavPredict(sem_mod, method = &quot;EBM&quot;)<br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><div class=\"gmail_default\"># colMeans(scores.ebm) #Results get wierd here.<br># cor(scores.ebm)<br>#mean values.<br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\"><br></div></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/attach/35d3c2773a48e/image.png?part=0.0.2&amp;view=1\" alt=\"image.png\" width=\"542\" height=\"364\"><br></div><div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\">Any idea about what could be happening? </div><br></div><div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\">I put my model in the link below and attached a simple script to reproduce these results. </div><br></div><div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\">Model file (300MB)</div></div><div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><a href=\"https://adaptativa-tmp.s3.sa-east-1.amazonaws.com/tmp.RDS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://adaptativa-tmp.s3.sa-east-1.amazonaws.com/tmp.RDS&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792417279497000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2MLsZQR_uLhxLoNS05IkUT\">https://adaptativa-tmp.s3.sa-east-1.amazonaws.com/tmp.RDS</a></div><br></div><div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\">Any thoughts or comments will be greatly appreciated.</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\">Regards,</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\">Hugo </div><br></div><div><br></div>-- <br><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br></div><div><br><table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-size:medium\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"left\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"10\"><p style=\"margin-right:10px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:14px\"><a href=\"http://www.adaptativa.com.br/\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.adaptativa.com.br/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792417279497000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2BmNu2dB6pq1i9oPgl8ASv\"><img src=\"https://ci4.googleusercontent.com/proxy/FE2I4wjFnN2cAFKRmI3TKMszOlSp21wnNu4SqBeCJZBTRvT_FvrlgmwCaxvFTesKdXjysxxb7nvH4if6T_hi884vh3N59BHtgm3-wqx9bgkcnTo-Jw1Bg01c1Tk3qGCKYDUC3lEyIIXfgYCyCshNyEk3Ee8Wg4ibOcS9FfxhtyTI=s0-d-e1-ft#https://htmlsigs.s3.amazonaws.com/logos/files/000/177/391/landscape/adaptativa_256px80pxL_72dpi_SEM_SLOGAN.jpg\" alt=\"Adaptativa\" border=\"0\" height=\"62\" width=\"200\"></a></p></td><td align=\"left\"><p style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:14px;color:rgb(33,33,33)\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;display:inline\">Hugo Harada</span><span style=\"display:inline\"><br></span>Sócio-fundador - COO</font><span style=\"font-size:12px\"></span></p><p style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12